                "value": "<table class=\"layouttemplate navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"margin:.25em;padding:.25em .5em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#ffffff);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--background-color-disabled,#eeeeee)\" data-nosnippet=\"\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/40px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Flag_of_Germany.svg/60px-Flag_of_Germany.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Dieser Text und viele andere auch sind ebenso in deutscher Sprache verf\u00fcgbar. Um diese sehen zu k\u00f6nnen, w\u00e4hle bitte auf dieser Webseite die Spracheinstellung \u201eDeutsch\u201c.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear:both;border:1px solid var(--background-color-disabled,#eeeeee);margin:.25em;padding:.25em .5em;background-color:var(--background-color-base,#ffffff);color:inherit;font-size:90%;\" class=\"searchaux\" data-nosnippet=\"\">\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HSSection_sign.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/120px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/HSSection_sign.svg/250px-HSSection_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" dat